WEBVTT

00:00:22.910 --> 00:00:26.290
<b>Chaika the Coffin Princess</b>

00:00:26.290 --> 00:00:27.050
<b>Chaika the Coffin Princess</b>

00:01:31.880 --> 00:01:33.230
The floating fortress

00:01:33.230 --> 00:01:36.000
dispatched by the Republic of 
Centr and the Wiepr Kingdom

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:37.530
has been shot down.

00:01:37.530 --> 00:01:41.410
Other nations have been attacked by 
the Principality of Hartgen, as well.

00:01:41.950 --> 00:01:46.260
It's believed that Hartgen is using 
a powerful Gundo to attack them.

00:01:46.740 --> 00:01:48.660
Shall we prepare to counterattack?

00:01:48.660 --> 00:01:51.420
Not yet. Once we open fire, 
there's no going back.

00:01:51.850 --> 00:01:53.840
We'll wait for the Gillette Squad's report.

00:02:00.250 --> 00:02:02.730
What's going on? What about the tournament?

00:02:02.730 --> 00:02:03.640
Who cares?!

00:02:03.640 --> 00:02:05.680
Hey! The throne room is in chaos!

00:02:05.680 --> 00:02:06.310
What?!

00:02:07.100 --> 00:02:09.140
Hey! Chaika, wait!

00:02:20.030 --> 00:02:23.530
The Girl Who Carries the Gundo

00:02:24.270 --> 00:02:25.910
Chaika! You okay?

00:02:27.200 --> 00:02:29.270
Layla's words, true.

00:02:31.390 --> 00:02:33.580
I am tool. Purpose served.

00:02:34.690 --> 00:02:36.580
No reason to live.

00:02:45.030 --> 00:02:47.260
We will relocate to a new castle.

00:02:48.600 --> 00:02:51.600
Come, The Gustilator.

00:02:54.320 --> 00:02:55.440
Brother!

00:02:55.440 --> 00:02:56.490
Toru!

00:02:57.910 --> 00:02:58.820
Shin.

00:02:59.780 --> 00:03:01.990
Accompany the emperor.

00:03:01.990 --> 00:03:02.740
Yes.

00:03:03.290 --> 00:03:04.560
Hang in there, Brother.

00:03:04.900 --> 00:03:07.010
Akari, run.

00:03:07.380 --> 00:03:09.420
Chaika's Gundo is in the corner of the room.

00:03:22.570 --> 00:03:24.620
Leave this place to us.

00:03:24.620 --> 00:03:26.470
Captain, inform headquarters.

00:03:26.810 --> 00:03:27.850
Thank you!

00:03:29.020 --> 00:03:33.350
Do you think there's anything 
you can do now, half-Chaika?

00:03:35.110 --> 00:03:36.360
Give back remains!

00:03:36.590 --> 00:03:40.610
Dear me. After I was kind 
enough to let you escape...

00:03:44.390 --> 00:03:45.400
You...

00:03:47.150 --> 00:03:48.290
What will you all do?

00:03:49.560 --> 00:03:50.670
I...

00:04:08.470 --> 00:04:09.410
Brother...

00:04:10.490 --> 00:04:14.730
Akari, as of this moment, 
I'm no longer a saboteur.

00:04:14.730 --> 00:04:17.210
You and I are no longer brother and sister.

00:04:18.850 --> 00:04:20.530
Brother, don't go.

00:04:21.440 --> 00:04:24.530
Fredrica, I will contract with you.

00:04:35.700 --> 00:04:38.550
Toru, eat my flesh.

00:04:39.030 --> 00:04:40.580
Otherwise, you'll die.

00:04:55.760 --> 00:04:57.400
Fredrica, let's go.

00:05:01.180 --> 00:05:02.780
I will defeat Gaz.

00:05:03.090 --> 00:05:04.650
Toru! I go with!

00:05:13.420 --> 00:05:14.470
Be safe.

00:05:21.820 --> 00:05:24.090
Toru, want to go with!

00:05:24.620 --> 00:05:25.710
Sorry.

00:05:28.410 --> 00:05:29.560
Toru!

00:05:31.500 --> 00:05:32.570
Why?

00:05:34.410 --> 00:05:39.380
Shin, I'm sure you think 
my behavior is strange.

00:05:39.380 --> 00:05:41.020
Ah, no...

00:05:41.020 --> 00:05:43.620
All the technology that I have developed

00:05:43.620 --> 00:05:47.030
is merely a gateway to much 
deeper magic research.

00:05:47.680 --> 00:05:51.180
If this castle and the Guys 
in the heavens are linked,

00:05:51.180 --> 00:05:53.810
the thoughts and feelings of all people on

00:05:53.810 --> 00:05:56.040
the continent will flow into me ceaselessly.

00:05:56.670 --> 00:06:00.750
There is still much that I must do.

00:06:23.360 --> 00:06:24.640
What is that?

00:06:27.180 --> 00:06:29.800
<i>Emperor Gaz is back? It can't be!</i>

00:06:30.190 --> 00:06:32.360
Gaz intends to start another war,

00:06:32.730 --> 00:06:36.470
and take in all the resulting fear and 
despair swirling about the continent

00:06:36.920 --> 00:06:39.040
to make it his own magic source.

00:06:39.470 --> 00:06:42.420
He has already killed King Hartgen.

00:06:42.960 --> 00:06:44.470
Our questioning within the castle

00:06:44.470 --> 00:06:47.800
revealed that the Principality of 
Hartgen's armaments are trivial.

00:06:48.640 --> 00:06:51.090
The black Chaika spread baseless rumors

00:06:51.090 --> 00:06:52.970
in an attempt to get King Hartgen

00:06:52.970 --> 00:06:54.030
<i>to start a war.</i>

00:06:54.030 --> 00:06:56.080
<i>Gaz set up all of this.</i>

00:06:56.490 --> 00:07:00.630
I see. I'll relay this to 
General Fyodor and the council.

00:07:01.010 --> 00:07:02.080
Give back!

00:07:05.260 --> 00:07:06.950
Give back remains!

00:07:06.950 --> 00:07:08.080
The remains are gone.

00:07:08.870 --> 00:07:12.720
She consumed all of the remains 
and brought Gaz back.

00:07:12.720 --> 00:07:14.410
Brought back Father?

00:07:14.830 --> 00:07:16.370
This is perfect.

00:07:16.370 --> 00:07:18.620
I'll make you into dolls, too.

00:07:21.090 --> 00:07:24.080
These girls are like Arina and Irina,

00:07:24.080 --> 00:07:26.800
my adorable little dolls.

00:07:27.360 --> 00:07:30.410
The half-Chaika can be your toy, girls.

00:07:30.410 --> 00:07:32.550
I'll play with the red one.

00:07:38.390 --> 00:07:39.680
What's going on here?

00:07:39.890 --> 00:07:41.100
Gaz is back?!

00:07:41.100 --> 00:07:43.260
Yes. Should we attack?

00:07:44.170 --> 00:07:46.180
No. We'll return immediately.

00:07:46.180 --> 00:07:46.770
What?

00:07:47.080 --> 00:07:49.350
Our army alone can't stand against him.

00:07:49.350 --> 00:07:52.110
If we go there now, Gaz gets 
exactly what he wants.

00:07:58.280 --> 00:08:01.000
Fredrica! Get us in, 
no matter what you have to do!

00:08:01.000 --> 00:08:02.670
Bust in anywhere!

00:08:06.030 --> 00:08:07.190
Barrier...

00:08:10.000 --> 00:08:12.340
Come, that which bursts and scatters!

00:08:12.340 --> 00:08:13.790
The Burster!

00:08:16.770 --> 00:08:18.060
Chaika...

00:08:18.060 --> 00:08:21.220
Okay, Fredrica! Keep blasting at it!

00:08:24.570 --> 00:08:26.510
I didn't expect him to come this far.

00:08:26.810 --> 00:08:28.240
He has earned my praise.

00:08:28.670 --> 00:08:30.400
Allow me to take care of him.

00:08:35.500 --> 00:08:37.320
Fredrica! Go in!

00:08:45.390 --> 00:08:48.090
This is Gaz's device for absorbing feelings,

00:08:48.090 --> 00:08:49.300
the "Guys"?

00:08:49.670 --> 00:08:51.940
It appears that once the 
first one is activated,

00:08:51.940 --> 00:08:54.730
it goes on to activate the 
next one, and so forth.

00:08:55.230 --> 00:08:58.100
He must be planning to link them all 
to the one that came down for him.

00:08:58.570 --> 00:09:01.520
How long do we have before 
they're all activated?

00:09:01.520 --> 00:09:03.200
I don't know the details,

00:09:03.200 --> 00:09:05.840
but it will most likely 
be complete by tonight.

00:09:05.840 --> 00:09:10.690
If that happens, all of our thoughts 
and feelings will become Gaz's.

00:09:10.690 --> 00:09:12.660
Is there nothing we can do?

00:09:26.340 --> 00:09:28.070
Where's your brother and the white girl?

00:09:28.340 --> 00:09:29.810
They went to defeat Gaz.

00:09:36.350 --> 00:09:37.630
I am steel.

00:09:38.160 --> 00:09:41.140
Steel knows no fear. Steel knows no doubt.

00:09:41.560 --> 00:09:44.980
When faced with my enemy, I hesitate not.

00:09:44.980 --> 00:09:47.500
I am a weapon to destroy these.

00:09:48.160 --> 00:09:49.420
Iron-Blood Transformation!

00:10:00.840 --> 00:10:01.780
Toru.

00:10:06.930 --> 00:10:08.490
Absorb feelings...

00:10:09.000 --> 00:10:10.270
Will not allow!

00:10:17.350 --> 00:10:19.130
So you've given up being a saboteur.

00:10:19.130 --> 00:10:21.480
Brother Shin, don't do it.

00:10:29.390 --> 00:10:31.530
Fredrica, stay out of this.

00:10:33.830 --> 00:10:36.900
Does this mean you finally 
understood my words?

00:10:36.900 --> 00:10:39.070
That had nothing to do 
with it. I chose this.

00:11:18.350 --> 00:11:19.340
Fredrica.

00:11:27.650 --> 00:11:29.490
That's right, Toru.

00:11:29.870 --> 00:11:32.250
You're not cut out to be a saboteur.

00:11:32.990 --> 00:11:35.340
That is best for you...

00:11:38.850 --> 00:11:40.720
Emperor Gaz awaits.

00:11:41.080 --> 00:11:44.060
Consider it an honor that he 
has consented to see you.

00:11:50.350 --> 00:11:51.780
Are they immortal?!

00:11:51.780 --> 00:11:52.940
They must have a weakness!

00:11:56.560 --> 00:11:58.150
Nikolai, you're late!

00:12:17.320 --> 00:12:19.710
Come, that which blows all away.

00:12:19.710 --> 00:12:21.190
The Blaust!

00:12:23.390 --> 00:12:25.590
That which protects, come undone!

00:12:25.590 --> 00:12:27.350
The Breaker!

00:12:43.800 --> 00:12:45.800
Don't forget...

00:12:45.800 --> 00:12:48.620
I fulfilled our objective.

00:12:49.080 --> 00:12:53.330
It was I who brought Father back.

00:12:53.330 --> 00:12:54.690
So what?!

00:13:01.240 --> 00:13:02.740
Did they get the black one?

00:13:06.690 --> 00:13:08.630
No effect...

00:13:14.390 --> 00:13:15.300
Toru...

00:13:17.330 --> 00:13:19.660
Come, resounding perception.

00:13:19.660 --> 00:13:21.200
The Locator!

00:13:34.370 --> 00:13:35.350
Gaz...

00:13:37.330 --> 00:13:40.390
I have lived for five hundred years by

00:13:40.390 --> 00:13:43.500
replacing my own body through magic.

00:13:43.970 --> 00:13:45.970
In doing so, I have reached a conclusion.

00:13:46.640 --> 00:13:50.050
Humans forever seek war.

00:13:50.620 --> 00:13:57.060
Humans kill other humans for 
anger, for hatred, and for love.

00:13:57.570 --> 00:14:00.060
A hundred, even two hundred years later,

00:14:00.060 --> 00:14:03.800
humans will kill one another for 
the most trivial of reasons.

00:14:04.370 --> 00:14:07.960
What is it that you hold 
in your heart right now?

00:14:08.450 --> 00:14:11.560
You are proof of all that is human.

00:14:12.110 --> 00:14:16.460
If you desire battle so deeply, 
you should work under me.

00:14:16.750 --> 00:14:17.900
Quiet.

00:14:17.900 --> 00:14:22.190
I have observed everything 
you all have done.

00:14:22.580 --> 00:14:25.870
Most of my body was carried 
here on your back,

00:14:25.870 --> 00:14:28.470
embraced within your heart.

00:14:29.460 --> 00:14:33.100
You have my praise. You did splendid work.

00:14:44.020 --> 00:14:45.440
I will kill you.

00:14:49.140 --> 00:14:50.340
Fredrica!

00:15:08.550 --> 00:15:12.720
Humans hold within their 
hearts the intent to kill.

00:15:13.120 --> 00:15:15.580
A stimulus no bigger than a thorn

00:15:15.580 --> 00:15:19.160
gives that intent control over their hearts.

00:15:21.130 --> 00:15:22.690
What did you say?

00:15:49.560 --> 00:15:53.110
Your heart is now filled 
with the intent to kill.

00:15:53.600 --> 00:15:57.680
You turn your blades upon me 
because you cannot restrain it.

00:15:58.280 --> 00:16:01.350
It is humans like you who 
respond to my expectations

00:16:01.350 --> 00:16:04.190
and do the best work for me.

00:16:04.880 --> 00:16:06.520
Serve me.

00:16:08.690 --> 00:16:13.030
Nobody is listening to what you say.

00:16:13.570 --> 00:16:17.950
You lived for five hundred years, 
and that's all you've got?

00:16:17.950 --> 00:16:20.370
I'm disappointed.

00:16:20.370 --> 00:16:23.460
Try being reborn one more time, bastard!

00:16:38.020 --> 00:16:41.400
Your existence fascinated me.

00:16:41.750 --> 00:16:43.570
But it ends now.

00:16:44.480 --> 00:16:45.850
The Shield!

00:16:51.020 --> 00:16:54.040
Hmm... Number 357, eh?

00:16:54.800 --> 00:16:56.410
My wand.

00:17:00.680 --> 00:17:01.830
Eliminate.

00:17:02.280 --> 00:17:04.110
<i>Establishing target.</i>

00:17:05.370 --> 00:17:06.540
<i>Target is...</i>

00:17:13.400 --> 00:17:15.050
Unable to lock on target.

00:17:15.350 --> 00:17:16.190
What?

00:17:16.190 --> 00:17:17.990
Cannot eliminate Chaika.

00:17:28.780 --> 00:17:30.940
Niva... Why?

00:17:31.410 --> 00:17:33.430
I have personality.

00:17:40.080 --> 00:17:41.910
<i>Please load charges.</i>

00:17:42.380 --> 00:17:44.260
Out of magic fuel.

00:17:44.260 --> 00:17:46.370
<i>Convert from magic fuel consumption mode</i>

00:17:46.370 --> 00:17:48.530
<i>to memory consumption mode?</i>

00:17:48.530 --> 00:17:49.380
Yes.

00:17:51.700 --> 00:17:53.130
<i>Target sighted.</i>

00:17:53.500 --> 00:17:55.200
<i>Destroy target?</i>

00:17:55.200 --> 00:17:57.400
Yes. I give father funeral.

00:17:57.750 --> 00:17:59.640
<i>Activating attack magic.</i>

00:18:01.720 --> 00:18:04.070
Zikra, azulwa, istatu...

00:18:04.600 --> 00:18:06.980
Come, to overwhelm and defeat.

00:18:07.600 --> 00:18:09.190
The Meraviglios!

00:18:37.760 --> 00:18:38.840
Brother...

00:18:40.260 --> 00:18:41.100
Chaika...

00:18:51.480 --> 00:18:52.560
Gillette-sama!

00:18:53.140 --> 00:18:55.310
The floating fortresses 
in space have stopped!

00:18:55.820 --> 00:18:57.530
Did that saboteur...

00:19:13.780 --> 00:19:14.870
Chaika...

00:19:16.950 --> 00:19:18.190
What did you do?

00:19:18.630 --> 00:19:19.670
Hey!

00:19:24.090 --> 00:19:26.390
Wake up, Chaika.

00:19:27.000 --> 00:19:28.020
Please...

00:19:28.640 --> 00:19:30.710
Don't leave me alone.

00:19:31.040 --> 00:19:32.010
Chaika!

00:19:38.060 --> 00:19:40.280
Five years after the war's end,

00:19:40.280 --> 00:19:44.060
after continuing to threaten the 
continent even following his death,

00:19:44.620 --> 00:19:47.300
the taboo emperor, Gaz, used the 
remains gathered by the Chaikas

00:19:47.300 --> 00:19:51.040
to return to life using magic, 
but destroyed himself shortly after.

00:19:51.560 --> 00:19:53.840
He and the floating fortresses 
vanished completely.

00:19:55.290 --> 00:19:59.850
And many girls believed to be Chaika, 
his alleged daughter, are confirmed dead.

00:20:00.690 --> 00:20:03.550
We have retrieved the emperor's 
fortune, the Gundo, as well.

00:20:03.820 --> 00:20:07.010
We have thus determined the 
issues regarding the Taboo

00:20:07.010 --> 00:20:10.560
Emperor and his daughter, 
Chaika, to be resolved.

00:20:10.940 --> 00:20:15.440
Chief Gillette, you have 
truly done magnificent work.

00:20:16.160 --> 00:20:19.070
Give the Nikolai Squad my thanks 
for their efforts, as well.

00:20:19.950 --> 00:20:21.400
Thank you, sir.

00:20:30.560 --> 00:20:31.760
Officer Konrad!

00:20:31.760 --> 00:20:34.080
Please, none of that.

00:20:34.370 --> 00:20:37.500
I'm still not used to that title.

00:20:37.980 --> 00:20:42.210
Chief Gillette, why don't 
you take some time off?

00:20:42.210 --> 00:20:45.590
No, as you can see, I have 
too much work to do.

00:20:46.380 --> 00:20:48.420
I've traded my sword for a pen,

00:20:48.830 --> 00:20:51.370
but it's not an easy thing to wield, is it?

00:20:52.710 --> 00:20:55.480
Chief, how is your wound coming along?

00:20:56.510 --> 00:20:59.980
What, this? It's only a scratch.

00:21:01.100 --> 00:21:02.490
To me, it's nothing more.

00:21:15.170 --> 00:21:16.410
Irritating!

00:21:16.410 --> 00:21:17.960
Fix door, when?!

00:21:18.240 --> 00:21:20.140
It won't be fixed until Brother fixes it.

00:21:20.140 --> 00:21:21.410
I won't fix it.

00:21:23.410 --> 00:21:24.260
Gift.

00:21:24.530 --> 00:21:25.800
Thanks for always bringing these.

00:21:25.800 --> 00:21:27.160
What writing?

00:21:27.490 --> 00:21:30.160
A tale of the intense love 
between two saboteurs.

00:21:30.160 --> 00:21:31.500
Finished writing?

00:21:31.500 --> 00:21:34.030
No, this is only the prologue.

00:21:34.030 --> 00:21:36.520
Their journey of love 
is only just beginning.

00:21:37.440 --> 00:21:39.370
White girl, where?

00:21:39.370 --> 00:21:41.070
Out for a walk with Brother.

00:21:41.490 --> 00:21:43.600
She seems to be feeling well today.

00:21:54.740 --> 00:21:57.140
Watch your step there.

00:21:59.690 --> 00:22:01.060
Thank you.
